{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：Google Workspace登录被标记可疑。对应需求：初始访问。官方：Google Workspace Login Flagged Suspicious。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-180m","index":["filebeat-*","logs-google_workspace.login*"],"interval":"60m","language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：Google Workspace登录被标记可疑","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：Google Workspace登录被标记可疑\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://knowledge.workspace.google.com/admin/security/user-login-attempts-report","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/google-workspace-attack-surface-part-one"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"93d2c5bf-dac1-4e0f-ab52-16f440782bb8","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 跨平台","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"data_stream.dataset: \"google_workspace.login\" and\n    event.provider: \"login\" and\n    google_workspace.login.is_suspicious: true\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1078.004","name":"Cloud Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1528","name":"Steal Application Access Token","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1528/"},{"id":"T1557","name":"Adversary-in-the-Middle","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1557/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}}],"related_integrations":[{"package":"google_workspace","version":"*"}],"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
